    {
      q: 'Which type of hot water system is best for my home?',
      a: 'The best system depends on your household size, energy tariff and connection type. Heat pumps offer the lowest running costs for homes with space for the unit. Gas continuous flow is ideal for large families or commercial settings. Solar is excellent where suitable roof orientation exists. We advise on the right system for your situation.',
